---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../../site';

const updated = '26 October 2026';
const repo = 'https://github.com/Geodude117/BattleShips';
---

<Base
  title="Salvo Sums privacy policy"
  description="Privacy policy for the Salvo Sums iPhone and iPad app. The app doesn't collect any personal data."
>
  <p class="eyebrow"><a href={url('salvo-sums/')}>Salvo Sums</a></p>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated {updated}</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <p class="summary">
      <strong>In short:</strong> Salvo Sums doesn't collect, store or share any personal data. Everything stays on your
      device.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Salvo Sums is made by Geovan, an independent developer based in the United Kingdom. This policy covers the Salvo
      Sums app for iPhone and iPad.
    </p>

    <h2>Information the app collects</h2>
    <p>None. Salvo Sums:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>has no accounts, sign-in or registration;</li>
      <li>doesn't ask for your name, email address, age, location, contacts, photos, camera or microphone;</li>
      <li>has no advertising, analytics, crash-reporting or tracking of any kind;</li>
      <li>doesn't include any third-party software that collects data;</li>
      <li>doesn't connect to the internet, so nothing is sent to us or anyone else.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
    <p>
      The app saves a small number of settings on your device using the standard iOS settings storage, such as whether
      sound effects are switched on. Future versions may also save your game progress, such as which maths topics you
      answer correctly, so the app can give you more practice where you need it.
    </p>
    <p>
      This information never leaves your device and we can't see it. It's deleted when you delete the app. If you use
      iCloud or device backups, it may be included in your own backup, under Apple's privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      Salvo Sums is designed for students, including under-18s studying for GCSE maths. Because the app doesn't collect
      any personal data, it doesn't collect data from children. It has no in-app purchases, advertising, chat or links
      that let children share information.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under UK data protection law you have rights over personal data that organisations hold about you. As Salvo Sums
      doesn't collect any personal data, we don't hold any data about you. You can remove everything the app has saved on
      your device by deleting the app.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If the app ever changes in a way that affects your privacy, this page will be updated before that version is
      released, and the date at the top will change.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Please
      <a href={`${repo}/issues/new`} rel="noopener" target="_blank">open an issue on GitHub</a> or see the
      <a href={url('salvo-sums/#support')}>Salvo Sums support page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .summary {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }
</style>
